                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd87b482-ff2f-45d5-8ea6-b1c91ab3c3db",
                                "sense_id": "777433ea-7c60-366e-a3a6-7dca80d37caa",
                                "text": "Man wird vielleicht sagen, der Setzer habe sich nichts um den Gießzettel oder die Polizze zu kümmern, dieser gehe bloß den Schriftgießer an. […] Unsere deutschen Schriftgießer haben ihre Gießzettel auf ein bestimmtes Gewicht fundirt,^([sic]) welche Grundlage viele Unzuträglichkeiten im Gefolge hat.",
                                "translation": "One might say that the typesetter has no need to worry about the bill of type or font, which concern only the type founder. […] Our German type founders have based their bills of type on a certain weight, which results in many disadvantages.",
                                "english": "One might say that the typesetter has no need to worry about the bill of type or font, which concern only the type founder. […] Our German type founders have based their bills of type on a certain weight, which results in many disadvantages."
